{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16981","headline":"奉酬淮南中书相公见寄 · 武元衡","name":"奉酬淮南中书相公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬州隋故都，竹使汉名儒。\n翊圣恩华异，持衡节制殊。\n朝廷连受脤，台座接讦谟。\n金玉裁王度，丹书奉帝俞。\n九重辞象魏，千[里]握兵符。\n铁马秋临塞，虹旌夜渡泸。\n江长梅笛怨，天远桂轮孤。\n浩叹烟霜晓，芳期兰蕙芜。\n雅言书一札，宾海雁东隅。\n岁月奔波尽，音徽雾雨濡。\n蜀江分井络，锦浪入淮湖。\n独抱相思恨，关山不可踰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}